  "notes": "{達成|たっせい} means achievement or accomplishment of a goal. Functions as noun or する verb.\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{達|たっ} (reach) + {成|せい} (accomplish).\n\nUSAGE AS VERB:\n{達成|たっせい}する: to achieve, to accomplish.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {目標|もくひょう}を{達成|たっせい}する: to achieve a goal\n- {達成感|たっせいかん}: sense of accomplishment\n- {達成|たっせい}{度|ど}: degree of achievement\n- {達成|たっせい}{率|りつ}: achievement rate\n\nCONTEXT: Common in business (sales targets), education, and personal goals.",
